    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Webiga Ka Soo Baxayay Daarta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana wuxuu mar kale i geeyey daarta albaabkeedii, oo bal eeg, biyaa ka soo hoos baxayay marinkii daarta dhankeeda bari, waayo, daarta horteedu waxay u sii jeedday xagga bari, oo biyuhuna waxay ka soo hoos baxayeen daarta dhankeeda midigta oo ah meesha allabariga dhinaceeda koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu jidkii iridda xagga woqooyi iga soo bixiyey, oo wuxuu ila wareejiyey jidkii dibadda ahaa oo iridda dibadda loo mari jiray oo ku dhinac yiil jidkii xagga bari u sii jeeday, oo bal eeg, biyaa dhankeeda midigta ka dareerayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo ninkii markuu xagga bari tegey isagoo gacanta xadhigga ku haysta wuxuu qiyaasay kun dhudhun, oo wuxuu i soo dhex mariyey biyihii oo anqowyada i jooga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana kun dhudhun ayuu qiyaasay oo biyuhuu i soo dhex mariyey, oo biyuhu waxay i joogeen lowyaha. Oo haddana kun dhudhun ayuu qiyaasay, oo biyuhuu i soo dhex mariyey, oo markanna biyuhu waxay i joogeen dhexda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo haddana kun dhudhun ayuu qiyaasay, oo markan waxay ahaayeen webi aanan lug kaga gudbi karin, waayo, biyihii kor bay u keceen, oo waxay noqdeen biyo lagu dabaasho iyo webi aan lug lagaga gudbi karin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo wuxuu igu yidhi, Wiilka Aadamow, waxan ma aragtay? Oo haddana wuu i soo waday oo wuxuu igu soo celiyey webiga qarkiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Haddaba markaan soo noqday, bal eeg, webiga qarkiisii waxaa ku yiil geedo tiro badan oo dhankan iyo dhankaasba kaga yaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasuu igu yidhi, Biyahanu waxay u baxayaan xagga dalka bari, oo waxay u dhacayaan tan iyo lamadegaanka Caraabaah la yidhaahdo, iyo xagga badda, biyihii baxayayna badday gelayaan oo biyuhuna way bogsan doonaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo meel alla meeshuu webigaasu gaadhoba wax kasta oo nool oo dhaqdhaqaaqaaba way noolaan doonaan, oo waxaa jiri doona kalluun aad iyo aad u faro badan, maxaa yeelay, biyahaasu halkaasay u tagaan inay biyaha baddu bogsadaan aawadeed iyo in wax kastaaba ay soo noolaadaan meel alla meeshuu webigaasu gaadhoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo kalluumaystayaashuna waxay istaagi doonaan badda qarkeeda, oo tan iyo Ceyn Gedii iyo ilaa Ceyn Ceglayim inta ka dhex leh waxay ahaan doontaa meel shabagyo lagu wadho, oo kalluunkooduna wuxuu ahaan doonaa cayn badan oo sida kalluunka badda weyn aad iyo aad u tiro badan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse meelaheeda dhoobada iyo biyagaleenka ahuba ma ay bogsan doonaan, illowse waxay ahaan doonaan cusbo miidhan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo webiga qarkiisana dhinacan iyo dhinacaasba waxaa ka bixi doona geed kasta oo la cuno, oo aan caleentiisu dhari doonin, oo aan midhihiisu dhammaan doonin. Oo bil kastaba wuxuu soo bixin doonaa midho cusub, maxaa yeelay, biyahoodu waxay ka soo baxaan meesha quduuska ah. Oo midhahoodu waxay ahaan doonaan cunto, caleentooduna dawo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Soohdimihii Dalka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Tanu waa inay ahaataa soohdinta aad dalka dhaxal ahaan ugu qaybsan doontaan siday laba iyo tobanka qabiil oo reer binu Israa'iil yihiin. Reer Yuusuf waa inuu laba qaybood helaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inaad dhaxashaan, oo intii midkiin helo waa in kan kalena uu intaas oo kale helaa, waayo, gacantaydaan kor ugu qaaday oo ku dhaartay inaan awowayaashiin siinayo, oo dalkaasu dhaxal buu idiin ahaan doonaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dalka soohdintiisa dhanka woqooyi waxay ahaan doontaa tan iyo badda weyn iyo jidka Xetlon iyo ilaa meesha laga galo Sedaad, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iyo Xamaad, iyo Beerotaah, iyo Sibrayim oo u dhaxaysa soohdinta Dimishaq iyo soohdinta Xamaad, iyo Xasar Hatiikoon oo ku ag taal soohdinta Xawraan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo soohdinta tan iyo badduna waxay ahaan doontaa Xasar Eenaan oo ah soohdinta Dimishaq, oo xagga woqooyina waa soohdinta Xamaad. Taasu waa soohdinta dhanka woqooyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo tan dhanka barina waxay ahaan doontaa Webi Urdun oo u dhexeeya Xawraan iyo Dimishaq iyo Gilecaad, iyo dalka reer binu Israa'iil. Tan iyo soohdintaas iyo ilaa badda bari waa inaad qiyaastaan, oo taasuna waa tan dhanka bari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhanka koonfureed xaggiisana waa tan iyo Taamaar iyo ilaa biyaha Meriibad Qaadeesh, iyo tan iyo webiga xagga badda weyn, oo taasuna waa soohdinta dhanka koonfureed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo tan dhanka galbeedna waxay ahaan doontaa badda weyn ilaa soohdinta koonfureed iyo ilaa la yimaado meel Xamaad ka soo hor jeedda. Oo taasuna waa soohdinta dhanka galbeed. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas waa inaad dalkaas u qaybsataan siday qabiilooyinka reer binu Israa'iil yihiin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo waa inaad dhaxal ahaan saami ugu qaybsataan idinka iyo shisheeyayaasha idin dhex deggan oo dhexdiinna carruurta ku dhalay, oo waxay idiin ahaan doonaan sida kuwa dalka ku dhex dhashay oo reer binu Israa'iil oo kale, oo iyaguna waa inay dhaxal idinkula qaataan qabiilooyinka reer binu Israa'iil dhexdooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Sayidka Rabbiga ahu wuxuu leeyahay, Kan shisheeyaha ahu qabiilkii uu dhex deggan yahay halkaas waa inaad dhaxalkiisa kala siisaan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
